### Get Products - Search
GET {{host}}/api/products?searchTerm=gaming

### Get Products - Search No Results
GET {{host}}/api/products?searchTerm=phone

### Get Products - Invalid Page Size
GET {{host}}/api/products?pageSize=101

### Get Products - Invalid Page Number
GET {{host}}/api/products?pageNumber=0

### Get Products - Filter By Category
GET {{host}}/api/products?categoryId=00b2dd31-9291-4ea9-a365-4fefb41f35e8

### Get Products - Category Has No Products
GET {{host}}/api/products?categoryId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Get Products - Active Products
GET {{host}}/api/products?isActive=true

### Get Products - Inactive Products
GET {{host}}/api/products?isActive=false

### Get Products - Sort By Price Ascending
GET {{host}}/api/products?sortBy=Price&sortDirection=Ascending

### Get Products - Pagination Page 1
GET {{host}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=1&sortBy=Price&sortDirection=Ascending

### Get Products - Pagination Page 2
GET {{host}}/api/products?pageNumber=2&pageSize=1&sortBy=Price&sortDirection=Ascending